  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第五关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
      "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#8",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "黑？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
      "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
      "text": "克洛宁的命令现在就是市长的命令，所有人，动手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
      "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
      "text": "把这些人都绑起来。注意不要伤到小姐了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#3",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "你说什么？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#3",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "你也以为我是在闹着玩吗？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "走！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "现在不是说话的时候！",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "保镖A",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "他们沿着这条路往沙滩跑了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "保镖B",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "啧，人太多了，不好追。联络沙滩的岗哨，围住他们！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "黑",
          "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
          "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "别想走！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "黑",
          "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
          "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "！？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "欸？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerToken": "char_188_helage_1",
          "operatorId": "char_188_helage",
          "portraitKey": "char_188_helage",
          "text": "博士，走，这里先交给我。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "锡兰",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#8",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "欸？！你，你是......！"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "锡兰，我们先走！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "锡兰",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#5",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "等一下，哈，哈......博士，我好累......"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "终于......到了沙滩......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我也......跑不动了......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "保镖",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_020",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "大小姐，请跟我们回去吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "锡兰",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#3",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "我不要！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "保镖A",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_020",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "别伤着大小姐，那个什么博士随便你们处置。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerToken": "char_188_helage_1",
          "operatorId": "char_188_helage",
          "portraitKey": "char_188_helage",
          "text": "谁敢随便处置博士！！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "保镖B",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_020",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "好烫好烫！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "保镖C",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_020",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "哪儿来的臭小鬼！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "保镖C",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_020",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "噫！我的屁股！我的屁股！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "speakerToken": "char_134_ifrit_summer_1",
          "operatorId": "char_134_ifrit",
          "portraitKey": "char_134_ifrit",
          "text": "喂，博士，你又惹上什么好玩的事情了，怎么不叫上我？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "保镖A",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_020",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "啧，只是一个臭小鬼，给她点颜色瞧瞧！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "speakerToken": "char_134_ifrit_summer_1",
          "operatorId": "char_134_ifrit",
          "portraitKey": "char_134_ifrit",
          "text": "我正愁无聊呢，嘿嘿......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "锡兰",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#8",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "博士，你的脸色怎么变得比刚才还差？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "伊芙利特，下手别太重！！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "把他们衣服烧光差不多了。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "speakerToken": "char_134_ifrit_summer_1",
          "operatorId": "char_134_ifrit",
          "portraitKey": "char_134_ifrit",
          "text": "啧——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "speakerToken": "char_134_ifrit_summer_1",
          "operatorId": "char_134_ifrit",
          "portraitKey": "char_134_ifrit",
          "text": "那就三成！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
